/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (This paper identifies the core security and patching failures behind modern Bluetooth attacks and proposes a novel, host-enforced Bluetooth Patch Accountability and Risk-Enforced Security Framework to bridge critical gaps in consumer cybersecurity.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [5]
>>
