75 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (The research identifies systemic failures such as implicit trust models and insecure firmware updates through an analysis of real-world attacks like audio eavesdropping and tracking. It then designs a framework utilizing Bluetooth Security Health Descriptors \(BSHD\) and host-enforced risk scoring.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
