77 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (The framework mitigates unauthorized access through restricted auto-reconnection, reduces tracking by penalizing static identifiers, and contains firmware-level compromise by isolating high-risk devices and limiting sensitive capabilities. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [12 13]
>>
