/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (By treating Bluetooth peripherals as first-class security assets, this framework introduces visibility and enforcement into the ecosystem, effectively reducing the risk of proximity-based threats even when vendor patching is absent.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [15]
