270 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 61 0 R
/E (The framework can be incrementally deployed, beginning with basic risk scoring for known vulnerabilities and expanding to comprehensive capability controls as adoption increases. Existing devices benefit immediately through vulnerability database integration, while future devices can implement BSHD reporting for enhanced accuracy.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
